\viewkind4\uc1\pard\tx3780\tx3960\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, we believe to us and ours 
\par The apostolic promise given ;
\par We wait the Pentecostal powers, 
\par The Holy Ghost sent down from heaven,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. To every one whom God shall call
\par The promise is security made ;
\par To you far off - He calls you all;
\par Believe the word which Christ hath said :
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. The Holy Ghost, if I depart,
\par The Comforter, shall surely come,
\par Shall make the contrite sinner's heart
\par His loved, His everlasting home.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Assembled here with one accord,
\par Calmly we wait the promised grace,
\par The purchase of our dying Lord :
\par Come, Holy Ghost, and fill the place.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. If every one that asks may find,
\par If still Thou dost on sinners fall,
\par Come as a mighty rushing wind ;
\par Great grace be now upon us all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Behold, to Thee our souls aspire,
\par And  languish Thy descent to meet :
\par Kindle in each the living fire, 
\par And fix in every heart Thy seat.\tab\tab 
\par                                       Amen.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

